// BT-3057: exercises the class-method self-send fast path
// (`generate_class_method_self_send` / `class_self_send_reflective_primitive`
// in dispatch_codegen.rs) for Behaviour-protocol reflective primitives —
// `superclass` (unary, returns a class object) and `includesSelector:`
// (keyword, returns a boolean) — sent directly to `self` or to an explicit
// same-class reference (BT-773) from inside a class method body, with no
// block or foreign process involved.

BT3057Ancestor subclass: BT3057Middle

  class selfSuperclassImplicitReturn => self superclass

  class explicitClassNameSuperclass => ^BT3057Middle superclass

  class selfIncludesDescribe => ^self includesSelector: #describe

  class selfIncludesBogus => ^self includesSelector: #bogusNotAMethod

  describe -> Symbol => #described
